1
00:00:00,112 --> 00:00:02,988
The world's greatest expert on power lost control

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,362
of his own body overnight.

3
00:00:04,775 --> 00:00:08,362
In 2018, Robert Greene suffered a severe stroke that

4
00:00:08,375 --> 00:00:10,350
paralyzed the left side of his body.

5
00:00:10,762 --> 00:00:11,412
No more hiking.

6
00:00:11,825 --> 00:00:12,475
No more swimming.

7
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,450
He couldn't even cut his own food.

8
00:00:14,862 --> 00:00:16,688
In the darkest depression of his life,

9
00:00:16,912 --> 00:00:18,888
he found the highest form of power:

10
00:00:19,288 --> 00:00:21,600
acceptance, and radical gratitude.

11
00:00:22,012 --> 00:00:24,238
Most of us walk through life half asleep,

12
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,588
never noticing the miracle of a walk in

13
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,700
the park, or tying our own shoes.

14
00:00:29,125 --> 00:00:31,338
Watch the full animated story on my channel,

15
